    "description": "Nestled in Pacific Heights' coveted LuXe building, this 1 bedroom + den (flex 2 bedroom) condominium offers a rare combination of style, luxury, and indoor/outdoor living. Step into the inviting living room with wide-plank white oak floors flowing throughout while elegant finishes create a modern aesthetic. A gourmet kitchen boasts premium appliances, Caesarstone quartz counters, Studio Becker cabinetry and beautiful entertaining island. A benefit of the first level location is a massive, and rarely available, exclusive outdoor terrace, tucked away and private in the sunny north end of the building. The primary suite overlooks the terrace and is complemented with a walk-in closet and a stylish bath offering a separate rainfall shower and soaking tub. A flexible den space is ideal for an office, cozy lounge, or guest room along with an extra powder room. The home boasts in-unit washer and dryer, 1-car side by side garage parking and & A/C. Building amenities include a secured, concierge attended lobby + bike storage, common area outdoor patio w/BBQ & community room. Situated just steps from great cafes, shopping, and restaurants in Pacific Heights, plus only mins to Union & Polk Streets w/ easy access to public transportation - boasting a 99 Walk Score. Truly a must see"
  },
